  {
    "id": "#/texts/68",
    "type": "text",
    "text": "As my father walked into the room, my brother cowered slightly (4#idth 4) . He sensed that he had done something 37__. I could see that he had 38 my father's new hymnal and scribbled (iL 涂 ) in it. Now he was waiting for his punishment.",
